The shipping change is confined to `game/vehicle/electric_body_kits.gd`. New `arch_joint` points fit the existing painted openings, the skirts taper down between their fitted ends, and the complete bumper returns now reach the opposite sides of the same openings. The door-area sheet metal, its seams and livery are unchanged. `electric_kits.gd`, the customisation catalogue, modular loader and all 62 hood mesh files are byte exact against the preceding refinement checkpoint. The hood bank also validates the exact existing body and mesh builder hashes. Other concurrent build-identity and Garage-cache changes predate or are outside this correction and were preserved.

